a:1:{s:49:"../../../domains/Provisioning/HostPowerReader.php";a:1:{i:0;O:49:"PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode":10:{s:55:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀name";s:42:"Onhost\Domain\Provisioning\HostPowerReader";s:57:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀phpDoc";O:50:"PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedPhpDocNode":4:{s:64:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedPhpDocNode␀phpDocString";s:567:"/**
 * Per-host power without a probe (audit §5n-6): a node whose `tags.bmc` names a management controller
 * (`{driver: redfish, url, chassis?, secret_ref?, insecure?}`) is read by the hourly usage watch before it snapshots; the
 * reading lands where a probe's would (`usage.power_w` + `usage.power_sampled_at`, then the hourly sample) so the
